<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#10171d"><title>AI Worker · The autonomous workshop</title><link rel="icon" href="/assets/logo.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/app.css?v=description-wrap-1"><script src="/assets/openai.js?v=suggestions-1" defer></script><script src="/assets/app.js?v=lucky-defaults-1" defer></script></head>
<body><header><a class="brand" href="#"><img src="/assets/logo.svg" alt="AI Worker logo"><span>AI<span class="brand-light">WORKER</span><small>THE AUTONOMOUS WORKSHOP</small></span></a><nav><a href="#" class="nav-link">Workloads</a><a href="#admin" id="admin-link" class="nav-link hidden">Administration</a></nav><div class="header-end"><span id="health" class="health">Connecting</span><time id="clock"></time><button id="account-button" class="subtle hidden">Account</button><button id="logout" class="subtle hidden">Sign out</button></div></header>
<main id="main"><div class="loading">Opening the workshop…</div></main><footer><span><span class="dot"></span> Ideas in. Working software out.</span><span>By Kawaiipantsu <span class="divider">/</span> <a href="https://thugs.red" target="_blank" rel="noopener">thugs.red ↗</a></span></footer>
<dialog id="project-dialog"><form id="project-form"><div class="dialog-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">LET’S BUILD SOMETHING</span><h2 id="project-title">New project / workload</h2></div><button type="button" data-close class="subtle" aria-label="Close">✕</button></div><div class="dialog-body"><input type="hidden" name="lucky_id" value=""><section id="lucky-summary" class="lucky-summary hidden"><span id="lucky-category" class="eyebrow"></span><p id="lucky-description"></p><details><summary>Generated JSON</summary><pre id="lucky-json-output" class="json-preview"></pre></details></section><label>Project / workload name<input name="name" required maxlength="160" placeholder="Your next great idea" autocomplete="off"></label><label>Workspace base directory<input name="workspace_base" maxlength="512" placeholder="/srv/projects"><span class="hint">Existing absolute directory writable by the worker. Leave empty to use the default.</span></label><label class="check"><input name="include_unique_id" type="checkbox" checked>Include unique ID in folder name</label><p class="hint" id="slug-preview">Workspace: /srv/projects/your-project-[unique ID]</p><label>Initial prompt<textarea name="prompt" required maxlength="100000" rows="7" placeholder="What should the worker build? Include goals, constraints, and what done looks like."></textarea></label><label>Scaffolding source<select name="scaffold_source"><option value="upload">Upload a ZIP (optional)</option><option value="url">Import a ZIP from a URL</option><option value="kawaiipantsu">Use Kawaiipantsu scaffold</option><option id="generated-option" value="generated" hidden disabled>Use generated starter files</option><option value="none">No scaffolding</option></select></label><label class="upload" id="upload-source">Scaffolding / base project <span class="hint">Optional ZIP · up to 32 MiB</span><input name="zip" type="file" accept=".zip,application/zip"></label><label id="url-source" class="hidden">Public ZIP URL<input name="zip_url" type="url" maxlength="2048" placeholder="https://example.com/project.zip"><span class="hint">Public HTTP/HTTPS URL · up to 32 MiB · redirects checked before import</span></label><p id="kawaiipantsu-source" class="hint hidden">Downloads scaffold.zip from the <a href="https://github.com/kawaiipantsu/ai-project-scaffold/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener">latest Kawaiipantsu release</a> when you create the workload.</p><section id="generated-source" class="upload hidden"><strong>Generated starter files</strong><p class="hint">Packaged as a ZIP and extracted when the project starts. Review or replace them before creating the workload.</p><ul id="generated-files" class="file-list"></ul><a id="scaffold-download" class="download-link" href="#">Download scaffold ZIP ↓</a></section><div class="form-grid"><label>AI worker<select name="provider"><option value="codex">Codex</option><option value="claude">Claude</option></select></label><label>Model<select name="model"></select></label><label>Worker run mode<select name="mode"><option value="yolo">YOLO · full access, no approval prompts</option><option value="bypass">Dangerously bypass / skip permissions</option><option value="auto">Auto · provider automatic approvals</option></select></label><label>Thinking strategy<select name="effort"></select></label></div><p class="hint">Auto uses Codex automatic review or Claude auto permissions. YOLO and bypass use the provider’s full-access mode.</p><label class="check"><input name="agents" type="checkbox">Enable agents <span class="hint">Allow delegation to subagents</span></label><label class="check" id="dynamic-label"><input name="dynamic_work" type="checkbox">Enable dynamic workload <span class="hint">Claude task-list workflow</span></label><p class="hint">The initial prompt and settings are saved in the project’s docs folder. Work starts automatically when a provider slot is available.</p><p class="form-error" id="project-error"></p></div><div class="dialog-foot"><button type="button" data-close class="secondary">Abort</button><button type="submit" class="primary">Create workload ↗</button></div></form></dialog>
<dialog id="account-dialog"><form id="password-form"><div class="dialog-head"><h2>Change password</h2><button type="button" data-close class="subtle">✕</button></div><div class="dialog-body"><label>Current password<input type="password" name="current" required autocomplete="current-password"></label><label>New password<input type="password" name="password" minlength="14" required autocomplete="new-password"></label><p class="form-error"></p></div><div class="dialog-foot"><button class="primary">Update password</button></div></form></dialog><dialog id="lucky-loading" class="lucky-loading"><div class="dialog-body"><span id="lucky-loading-spinner" class="spinner spinner-large" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="eyebrow">GPT-5.6-TERRA</span><h2>Finding your next project</h2><p id="lucky-progress" role="status" aria-live="polite">OpenAI is working…</p><p id="lucky-error" class="form-error" role="alert"></p><button id="lucky-abort" type="button" class="secondary">Abort / close</button></div></dialog><div id="toast" role="status"></div></body></html>
